  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Telekinesis sphere, Nature sphere ((metal) package).</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Whenever you use the (metal) geomancing Recover Ore ability, you may use telekinesis to Bludgeon another target creature or object with the metal ore recovered in this way, all as part of the same action. If you increase the casting time by 1 step (usually from a standard to full-round action), you may utilize your caster level instead of your base attack bonus for the first attack roll, and add your casting ability modifier to damage.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/nature#toc78\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
